    "path": "/description",
    "raw": "A log explaining turbulent past of the Skath.",
    "value": "一份关于海鳞族动荡过往的日志记述。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Skath 'history' as we know it goes back only two to three hundred years, at which point it becomes a very different tale...one of sorrow and misery, slavery and death. You see, close to the time they began interstellar exploration the Skath were anxious to meet others in their galactic neighborhood.",
    "value": "我们所知的海鳞族“历史”仅可追溯至两三百年之前，自那时起，它便成为一段截然不同的故事...充满悲伤、苦难、奴役与死亡。须知，就在海鳞族初涉星际探索之际，他们曾迫切渴望与星系近邻相遇。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "This eagerness would prove folly, for the nearest species to them (whom they refer to as Volarian, though no record of this species exists in current records) was of a hostile sort and saw only a new food source in the Skath people. And feed they did, with the help of their terrible machines.",
    "value": "这份急切终被证明是愚蠢的。距离他们最近的物种（海鳞族称之为“沃拉里安人”，尽管现有记载中并无该物种的记录）怀有敌意，仅将海鳞族视作新的食物来源。凭借其恐怖机械，他们大肆掠食。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Unable to compete technologically with the hostile invaders, the Skath ceased all resistance activity within six to nine months (records are spotty on this detail) and simply accepted their fate. And for almost two hundred years they worked as food and slaves, bred for the enjoyment of their oppressors.",
    "value": "海鳞族无法在技术上与凶残的侵略者抗衡，抵抗活动在六至九个月内全面终止（相关记载零散残缺），他们只得接受命运。近二百年间，他们作为食物与奴隶，为压迫者的取乐而被迫繁衍。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Underneath the waves, a different sort of resistance had begun. A large contingent of Skath had retreated into the oceans and seas where the enemy was unable to follow (or unwilling, records do not specify either way). Using stolen technology merged with their own, new methods of resistance were devised. All they needed now was a chance to strike.",
    "value": "然而在波涛之下，另一种抵抗悄然开始。一支大规模的海鳞族部队退入深海，敌人无法（或不愿）追击（记载未明确具体方向）。他们将窃取的技术与自身技艺融合，谋划出新的抵抗方式。此刻所需的，仅是一个出击的契机。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/4",
    "raw": "Eventually, the invaders began to stretch themselves too thin in Skath space, and eventually exposed a weakness. It was at this point that the Skath were able to turn the tide with their new Plasmic weapon technology (reverse engineered from that of the invading forces) and reclaim their freedom.",
    "value": "最终，侵略者在海鳞族疆域内过度扩张，暴露出弱点。恰在此时，海鳞族凭借新型等离子武器技术（通过对入侵部队装备的逆向工程研发）扭转战局，重获自由。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/5",
    "raw": "Their stories claim the invaders ran in fear, never to return. Based on their narrative, however, it is surmised that in truth the invaders were themselves eliminated by another force entirely...or are still among us. If my theories are accurate ,the chances are high they were in fact the Ghex; they were recently eaten to extinction by the Xitix-Thelus on the fringes of known space.",
    "value": "据传侵略者仓惶逃离，再未归来。但根据海鳞族的叙述，可推测入侵者实则被另一股力量彻底消灭...或仍潜藏于我们之中。若我的理论成立，他们极有可能正是已被灭绝的格赫克斯族，该族近期在已知空间边缘被希提克斯的蚁族吞噬而亡。"
  }
]